        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Norton 7500 Barrier Free Door Closer</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Norton 7500  institutional door closer are ADA compliant  and adjustable in the full spring range 1 - 6. The are narrow projection door controls: projection is just 2-1/8\" from the surface of the door or the jamb.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNorton 7500 are full cover closers available in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish. They are lighter powered to reduce door opening resistance to manageable levels for the handicapped and still provide superior  door control.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNon-handed and have individual adjustments for sweep speed, latch speed,  and backcheck cushioning.  They are tri packed for regular, top jamb or parallel arm installations. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1461_closer_dimensions-2.gif?v=1704354744\" width=\"365\" height=\"140\" border=\"0\" alt=\"LCN 1461 Door Closer Mounting Holes\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of Norton 7500 Series Closer\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable back check</li>\r\n<li>Aluminum Alloy Shell</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 44\" interior / 36\" exterior</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 243 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Spring Tension: Adjustable 1 - 6</li>\r\n<li><b>Tri packed for regular, top jamb or parallel arm mounting</b></li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li><b>Optional Hold Open Arm</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Includes Closer Cover</li>\r\n<li>Grade 1 Certified</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7500.pdf?v=1704262193\" target=\"new\"><b>Norton 7500 Information Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>NOTE: the standard arm shown in the upper right product image is included.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nYou can add an optional Hold Open Arm if desired.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-53904-SM.jpg?v=1704354624\" width=\"450\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Closer Accessories\">\r\n</p>",
